==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Trust Fund}}

==Battleground==
*12 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*4 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Loris]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Relic Bun-Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Loris]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Condemned Peng]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The combination of enemies here along with the inability to acquire cash from them is scary. However, powercreep comes to save the day.

[[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone Cat]] and [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] are extremely useful. [[Ancient Egg: N000 (Special Cat)|Ape Lord Luza]] is also hard-counters Relic Bun-Bun if you have Cone to defend.

You will want to stall in the beginning to wait for your Mythic cats to go off cooldown. [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train]] can take a chunk of HP out of Doge Dark and quickly slip into Loris' blindspot. Once you summon your Mythic cats (Uril will do the trick), meatshield well and send in [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Doron]] whenever an annoying enemy comes into range.

